## 1. Summary of Changes
- Implemented 2D viewport scrolling in `DesignSurface` including horizontal and vertical scrollbars, thumb dragging, page scrolling, and mouse wheel navigation (`Shift`+wheel for horizontal scroll).
- Added typography metadata (`FontWeight`, `FontFamily`), enum parsing, inspector editors, and canvas rendering for `FontSize`, `FontFamily`, `FontWeight`, `Foreground`, `Background`, and dimmed non-visible elements.
- Enabled complete runtime property reflection in `LiveFormRunner` for `controls::Control` subclasses (`Background`, `Foreground`, `FontSize`, `FontFamily`, `FontWeight`, `Visibility`, `Padding`, `Borders`).
- Updated `FormClassEmitter` for strongly-typed typography code generation.

